  "id": "anomaly.builtin.nte-time-accel",
  "name": "Time Accel",
  "description": "NTE time acceleration (world time dilation): sets a time dilation multiplier on the game world so the whole game runs faster. Hotkeys can be rebound in the UI; Backspace unbinds. The bottom line shows the multiplier actually in effect. Character damage may be anomalous at 2x and above.",
